  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop celery.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Cut firm tofu into 1cm chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine sweet soy seasoning, the plain flour and a good pinch of salt. Add tofu, tossing to coat.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce and the low sodium soy sauce.\n• In a large heatproof bowl, combine garlic and a drizzle of olive oil. Microwave in 10 second bursts until fragrant.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66f62be94c65e1fd73e1dc36-7ad149d8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, cook tofu, tossing occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Remove from heat, then add sweet chilli-soy mixture, tossing tofu to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66f62be94c65e1fd73e1dc36-1781eb00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, to bowl with garlic oil, add mayonnaise, sesame dressing and sriracha, stirring to combine.\n• Add celery, shredded cabbage mix and mixed salad leaves, tossing to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66f62be94c65e1fd73e1dc36-c868f33c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide sesame sriracha slaw between bowls.\n• Top with sweet soy tofu bites.\n• Sprinkle with crushed peanuts to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66f62be94c65e1fd73e1dc36-8327a2d0.jpeg"
    }
  ]
